---
interface Props {
  bookingNotes?: string;
  cancellationPolicy?: string;
}

const { bookingNotes, cancellationPolicy } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="booking">
  <h2 class="bk-heading">预订须知</h2>

  {bookingNotes && (
    <details class="bk-accordion">
      <summary class="bk-summary">预订流程</summary>
      <div class="bk-content">
        <p>{bookingNotes}</p>
      </div>
    </details>
  )}

  {cancellationPolicy && (
    <details class="bk-accordion">
      <summary class="bk-summary">退改政策</summary>
      <div class="bk-content">
        <p>{cancellationPolicy}</p>
      </div>
    </details>
  )}

  <details class="bk-accordion">
    <summary class="bk-summary">签证须知</summary>
    <div class="bk-content">
      <p>签证办理由我们全程协助。请在出发前至少 6 周与我们联系，我们将指导您准备所需材料。部分目的地可提供加急签证服务。</p>
    </div>
  </details>

  <details class="bk-accordion">
    <summary class="bk-summary">旅行保险</summary>
    <div class="bk-content">
      <p>我们强烈建议所有旅客购买综合旅行保险，涵盖医疗运送、行程取消和行李丢失。我们可协助推荐合适的保险方案。</p>
    </div>
  </details>
</section>

<style>
  .booking {
    max-width: var(--spacing-content-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 2rem 0;
  }
  .bk-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }
  .bk-accordion {
    border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text-muted) 20%, transparent);
  }
  .bk-summary {
    padding: 1rem 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .bk-summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
  .bk-summary::after {
    content: "+";
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }
  details[open] .bk-summary::after {
    content: "−";
  }
  .bk-content {
    padding: 0 0 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .bk-content p {
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>